Name: cksum
URL: https://github.com/madler/zlib
Version: 1.3.1
Revision: 51b7f2abdade71cd990e7420a3b618224d068f2c
License: Zlib
License File: LICENSE
Description: Checksum library (CRC-32) derived from zlib for Zircon kernel and userland.
Local Modifications:
- Modernized types to standard uint32_t, const uint8_t*, size_t.
- Removed unused adler32, crc16, and full zlib compression/decompression APIs.
